{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a theme and craft your own story by making branching choices that shape each unique adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll be able to explore distinct themes, each offering a unique scenario: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a seven-year journey at a magic school, where you'll master your powers and unravel ancient mysteries </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead a party of heroes on a rescue mission to save a lost prince</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Establish and fortify an outpost in newly conquered territory, ensuring the prosperity and security of your ancient empire\u2019s expansion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Including a variety of unique themes and situations to start your journey from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customize characters looks, abilities and backstories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Guide your story with meaningful choices that mold your characters and their world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Intuitive controls, game-play and interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Cute 3D art-style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover secret and hidden elements to personalize your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Be careful, as you shape your creations, they shape <strong>you</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136090/dd7a3f7eb7df4cc934633c8f3bf0eb2ae9267bc4.jpg"},{"name":"Graduation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136090/56be06a5acec1fa2acd4fea55ad93bba3b302b42.jpg"},{"name":"Royal Ascension","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136090/566abaecff49b284dfd47